{
  "name": "Waitlist (captación + correos)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "waitlist",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "wl-webhook",
      "name": "Webhook waitlist",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "waitlist",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Web Electrificarte (x-electrificarte-secret)"
        }
      },
      "notes": "La Production URL de este nodo va en Vercel como N8N_WAITLIST_URL."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "tableId": "waitlist",
        "dataToSend": "defineBelow",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldId": "first_name",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.firstName }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "last_name",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.lastName }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "email",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.email }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "phone",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.phone }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "model",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.model }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "source",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.body.source }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "wl-supabase",
      "name": "Guardar en Supabase",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Supabase (service_role)"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Si tu webhook no envuelve el body en 'body', quitá '.body' de las expresiones."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.resend.com/emails",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "keypair",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "from",
              "value": "Electrificarte <no-reply@electrificarte.com>"
            },
            {
              "name": "to",
              "value": "={{ $('Webhook waitlist').item.json.body.email }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "subject",
              "value": "Ya estás en la waitlist de Electrificarte"
            },
            {
              "name": "html",
              "value": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\">\n  <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark\">\n  <title>Electrificarte</title>\n</head>\n<!--\n  WAITLIST: confirmación a la persona que se registró. Va al nodo Resend de n8n.\n  Lee del nodo \"Webhook waitlist\": body.firstName, body.model (opcional).\n  ⚠️ La waitlist SOLO registra interesados: no prometer una oferta, no dar plazos y no decir\n  que el servicio de negociación es o será gratis.\n\n  GENERADO por scripts/gen-emails.mjs (sistema de diseño v1). No editar a mano: cambiá el\n  generador y corré  node scripts/gen-emails.mjs && node scripts/gen-waitlist-reviews-workflows.mjs\n  Todo dato que escribe el usuario va escapado para HTML.\n-->\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f2f7f6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\">\n  <div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;\">Quedaste registrado en la waitlist de Electrificarte.</div>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f2f7f6;\">\n    <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:32px 12px;\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;\">\n\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:0 4px 20px;\">\n          <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n            <td><picture><source srcset=\"https://www.electrificarte.com/brand/email-wordmark-niebla.png\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"><img src=\"https://www.electrificarte.com/brand/email-wordmark-tinta.png\" alt=\"Electrificarte\" width=\"218\" height=\"16\" style=\"display:block;border:0;width:218px;height:16px;\"></picture></td>\n            \n          </tr></table>\n        </td></tr>\n\n        <tr><td style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dfe4e4;border-radius:12px;padding:36px 32px 32px;\">\n<h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0f1716;\">Ya estás en la lista</h1>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#495251;\">Hola <strong style=\"font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;\">{{ String(($('Webhook waitlist').item.json.body.firstName) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') }}</strong>, registramos tus datos. Te contactaremos cuando abramos el acceso y tengamos novedades para ti.</p>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;background:#caefea;border-radius:12px;\">\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:20px;\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#0f1716;\">Auto que te interesa</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#0f1716;\">{{ String(($('Webhook waitlist').item.json.body.model) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') || 'Aún no lo definiste' }}</p>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#495251;\">Mientras tanto puedes seguir explorando el catálogo. Si todavía no tienes claro qué auto te conviene, la <strong style=\"font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;\">Asesoría</strong> te ayuda a decidir según tu uso, tu presupuesto y dónde vas a cargar.</p>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0;\"><tr>\n  <td style=\"border-radius:8px;background:#1d605b;\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.electrificarte.com/marcas\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;\">Ver el catálogo &rarr;</a>\n  </td>\n</tr></table>\n        </td></tr>\n\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:24px 4px 0;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#687170;\">\n          Electrificarte, marketplace de autos electrificados en Chile.<br>\n          <a href=\"https://www.electrificarte.com\" style=\"color:#1d605b;text-decoration:underline;\">electrificarte.com</a> y <a href=\"mailto:contacto@electrificarte.com\" style=\"color:#1d605b;text-decoration:underline;\">contacto@electrificarte.com</a>\n        </td></tr>\n\n      </table>\n    </td></tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "wl-mail-cliente",
      "name": "Correo confirmación (persona)",
